<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Amerin raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Amerin raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst Gary Gordon raised his rating of Amerin Corp to buy from attractive on Monday, according to a source at the firm.</p>
<p>-- Amerin shares closed at 18-5/8 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.  </p>
<p>-- Gordon later confirmed the rating change, saying the move was based on the stock's price.</p>
</text>
